flowchart TD
  start([Guest or member opens route]) --> shell[Existing navigator with newspaper shell]
  shell --> route{Feed route?}
  route -->|Yes| source[Resolve active feed source]
  route -->|No| normal[Existing screen and neutral context]
  source --> known{Metadata verified or supplied?}
  known -->|Yes| display[Show source with evidence qualifier]
  known -->|No| unknown[Show unknown inputs and ordering]
  display --> state{Query state?}
  unknown --> state
  state -->|Loading| loading[Existing loading state]
  state -->|Error| failure[Existing retry state]
  state -->|Success or empty| feed[Existing feed rows or empty state]
  normal --> done([Usable responsive route])
  loading --> done
  failure --> done
  feed --> done
  %% web shell, desktop rails, feed query source; no new API
